== Trivia ==
* The item's name may be a reference to the X-Men villain, ''[[wikipedia:Magneto (comics)|Magneto]].''
* This item's coloration and placement on Isaac's head may be a nod to ''[[megaman:Magnet Man|Magnet Man]]'', a villain from ''Mega Man 3''.
* Despite what the description says, Magneto will not attract passive or active items.
* {{t|Broken Magnet}} appears to be half of this item, and indeed retains part of its function.

